{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/news/update-air-strikes-against-daesh","content_id":"1ee8165f-1e3f-43b9-8bbb-8569258f1952","description":"The RAF are continuing to take the fight to Daesh in Iraq and Syria.","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><h2 id=\"saturday-3-january-2026\">Saturday 3 January 2026</h2>\n\n<p>Royal Air Force aircraft have continued to conduct patrols over Syria to help prevent any attempted resurgence of the Daesh terrorist movement following its military defeat at Baghuz Fawqani in March 2019. Careful intelligence analysis identified an underground facility, in the mountains some miles north of the ancient site of Palmyra. This facility had been occupied by Daesh, most likely to store weapons and explosives. The area around the facility is devoid of any civilian habitation.</p>\n\n<p>RAF Typhoon FGR4s, supported by a Voyager refuelling tanker, therefore joined French aircraft in a joint strike on the underground facility on the evening of Saturday 3 January.  Our aircraft used Paveway IV guided bombs to target a number of access tunnels down to the facility; whilst detailed assessment is now underway, initial indications are that the target was engaged successfully. There is no indication of any risk having been posed to civilians by the strike, and all our aircraft returned safely.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"related-information\">Related information</h3>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/british-forces-air-strikes-in-iraq-monthly-list\">British forces air strikes in Iraq and Syria: monthly list</a></p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Added information on the air strike conducted on 3 January 2026.","public_timestamp":"2026-01-13T13:10:56Z"},{"note":"Webpage updated with details of an air strike against Daesh on 28 September 2025.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-03T15:35:26Z"},{"note":"3 November 2025\r\nWebpage updated with details of an air strike against Daesh on 4 September 2025.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-03T15:24:23Z"},{"note":"Updated to add 10 June strike","public_timestamp":"2025-07-09T14:43:02Z"},{"note":"Webpage updated with details of an air strike against Daesh on 25 February 2025.","public_timestamp":"2025-03-06T12:42:35Z"},{"note":"Webpage updated with details of an air strike against Daesh on 18 June 2024.","public_timestamp":"2024-09-16T09:53:50Z"},{"note":"Updated page to include 21 April 2024 strike.\r\nPreviously listed strike below removed:\r\n* Tuesday 2 May 2023 - RAF Typhoons struck two Daesh terrorist targets in north eastern Iraq.","public_timestamp":"2024-04-27T11:16:03Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2024-04-26T23:00:00Z"},{"note":"Updated with details of an air strike on 2 May 2023. ","public_timestamp":"2023-05-25T09:47:40Z"},{"note":"Date of the most recent strike updated to clarify that it occurred in 2022. \r\n\r\nPrevious strike updates removed and added to the guidance page \"British forces air strikes in Iraq and Syria: monthly list\".","public_timestamp":"2023-03-24T11:08:24Z"},{"note":"Updated with details of a strike on 20 December 2022.","public_timestamp":"2022-12-22T15:46:38Z"},{"note":"Update: RAF Reaper strike on Daesh terrorist in Iraq","public_timestamp":"2022-10-13T09:02:25Z"},{"note":"Update: RAF Reaper strike on Daesh terrorists in Iraq","public_timestamp":"2022-07-02T10:03:13Z"},{"note":"Updated strike statement ","public_timestamp":"2021-12-16T15:48:25Z"},{"note":"Updated on Saturday 27 November.","public_timestamp":"2021-11-27T09:16:49Z"},{"note":"Updated strike statement","public_timestamp":"2021-09-20T14:31:52Z"},{"note":"Added content under useful information heading.","public_timestamp":"2021-06-25T15:32:27Z"},{"note":"Updated Strike Statement","public_timestamp":"2021-05-17T09:53:31Z"},{"note":"Updated strike activity. ","public_timestamp":"2021-04-08T10:23:30Z"},{"note":"Update on latest strikes","public_timestamp":"2021-03-23T11:57:19Z"},{"note":"Updating strike statem